abstract: >
  Living reference manual and curated bibliography on hallucination in large
  language models, framed around reliability engineering and verification
  and validation for defense-related AI systems. Maintained by the Grupo de
  Confiabilidade at the Instituto Militar de Engenharia (IME), Brazil.
